  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">Hi all，</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">【星河秘境</span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">】活动将于6.10日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源及礼物配置。</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">资源配置</span></p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>资源类型</td><td>资源名称</td><td>资源id</td><td>图片</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>座驾</td><td>辰星同行进房座驾</td><td>7579</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NzM3ODA3Mjg0OCM0MTAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NzM3ODA3Mjg0OCM0MTAjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>资料卡浮屏</td><td>秘境主宰资料卡浮屏</td><td>2934</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"4\">头像框</td><td>浪漫星河头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>辰星同行头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星途领曜动态头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秘境主宰头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>送礼托盘</td><td>辰星同行送礼托盘</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>热门卡</td><td>热13推荐卡</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>15min&nbsp;&nbsp; 7天</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"3\">麦序框</td><td>浪漫星河麦序框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>辰星同行麦序框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星途领曜动态麦序框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>观众席底纹</td><td>辰星同行观众席底纹</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"5\">挂件</td><td>浪漫星河主页挂件</td><td>5190</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNzY3MDQyNDg0OSM4MjYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNzY3MDQyNDg0OSM4MjYjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>辰星同行主页挂件</td><td>6993</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MjEzNDQ0NSM2OTkjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MjEzNDQ0NSM2OTkjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星途领曜主页挂件</td><td>5539</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcyMTE4NjY3MTcyMCMzMjcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcyMTE4NjY3MTcyMCMzMjcjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星途领曜主页浮屏</td><td>5122</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNTc1NzkyODQxNyM3NDcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNTc1NzkyODQxNyM3NDcjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秘境主宰挂件</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"3\">公聊皮肤</td><td>浪漫星河公聊皮肤</td><td>3288</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY2Nzg4MTQ4NDE1MiM1NDEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY2Nzg4MTQ4NDE1MiM1NDEjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>辰星同行公聊皮肤</td><td>9686</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDI4Nzg5ODUwMCMgODMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MDI4Nzg5ODUwMCMgODMjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星月梦幻公聊角标</td><td>2397</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYzNDI4ODI2Mjc0OSMyNjYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYzNDI4ODI2Mjc0OSMyNjYjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">浮屏</td><td>浪漫星河主页浮屏</td><td>9750</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI0NDU0NDQzNSM1NjcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI0NDU0NDQzNSM1NjcjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秘境主宰浮屏</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>发言波纹</td><td>辰星同行发言波纹</td><td>4102</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MjY4ODE3NzMwNiM3MzkjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MjY4ODE3NzMwNiM3MzkjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"5\">称号</td><td>浪漫星河称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>6.12-6.15&nbsp; 星河秘境活动获得～</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>辰星同行称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星途领曜称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秘境主宰称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><span>财神爷</span><span>进房座驾</span></td><td>4737</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNjA4MjAzNjA2NSMgMjAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwNjA4MjAzNjA2NSMgMjAjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">以上如有问题，及时沟通～</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p>",
